                                "example_id": "97736cb8-e06f-418a-8c0a-2d6b537f2c46",
                                "sense_id": "a117c09d-9552-389d-880a-0d334833e1e0",
                                "text": "These are villainous engines indeed; but take heart, Numps! here is not a word of the stocks; and you need never stand in awe of any more honourable correction."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a1bce07-7495-4916-b374-b18b67729f27",
                                "sense_id": "a117c09d-9552-389d-880a-0d334833e1e0",
                                "text": "\"You're a dizzard!\" I retorted. \"And a noodle and a jolt-head; you're a jobbernowl and a doodle, a maundering mooncalf and a blockheaded numps, a gaby and a loon; you're a Hatter!\" I shrieked the last epithet."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
